properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a+2x & =b \\\\ 2x & =b-3a \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2}(b-3a) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2}([\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]-3[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}] \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/state.json" "file_sha256" "3693b0643c1637beb0ed893dfd77bc3fee5e50bf0bbf7e312c52cf34eea746d7" "basis" 1628 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73931" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "277a1276fba71699bb031c7c6ec50d19a68b1ac54e98c9c2b1323f94e6b8525b" "basis" 1628 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73931" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/state.json" "file_sha256" "3693b0643c1637beb0ed893dfd77bc3fee5e50bf0bbf7e312c52cf34eea746d7" "basis" 1628 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042052/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73931" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "