can tell that $h=2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105152" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a70cb16ea7c938975cb7f05d7d1eb3f8f5c1010f3b7770c1c30064bcb693fa5f"} {"question" "q-105152" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105152" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-1"] ["math" "-2"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2"] ["text" "No solution"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105152" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $k$, if $8{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=0$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =0 \\\\ 8[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]+k[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-8[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}24 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 32\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the first components, we get \n\n$$\n-2k=24\\,⟹\\,k=-12.\n$$\n\nBut then \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-12[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}24 \\\\ -36 \\\\ 48\\end{aligned}]\\ne [\\begin{aligned}24 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 32\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, there is no $k$ such that \n $8{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a70cb16ea7c938975cb7f05d7d1eb3f8f5c1010f3b7770c1c30064bcb693fa5f"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-12"] ["math" "-6"] ["math" "-8"] ["math" "4"] ["text" "No solution"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34602" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "No solution"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $l$, if $5{a}_{1}+l{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 25 \\\\ 16\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $l$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{a}_{1}+l{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 5[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]+l[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 25 \\\\ 16\\end{aligned}] \\\\ l[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 25 \\\\ 16\\end{aligned}]-5[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\ l[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 15 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that \n$l=3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a70cb16ea7c938975cb7f05d7d1eb3f8f5c1010f3b7770c1c30064bcb693fa5f"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2"] ["math" "3"] ["math" "6"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34600" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-34241" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $j$, if ${a}_{1}-j{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc7