nd{aligned}].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -7 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 14 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 14 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & 7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+7{x}_{3}=5 \\\\ {x}_{2}=2 \\\\ 0=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=-3$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105170" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a70cb16ea7c938975cb7f05d7d1eb3f8f5c1010f3b7770c1c30064bcb693fa5f"} {"question" "q-105170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3"] ["math" "-5"] ["math" "5"] ["math" "6"] ["text" "No solution"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105170" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "No solution"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105169" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105169" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 5{x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} \\\\ 6{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{3} \\\\ -8{x}_{3} \\\\ 2{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-8{x}_{3} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}-8{x}_{3}=-3 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-5){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -13 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -13 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=-13 \\\\ 0=8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0=8$  gives a false statement. So the system has no solution." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105169" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a70cb16ea7c938975cb7f05d7d1eb3f8f5c1010f3b7770c1c30064bcb693fa5f"} {"question" "q-105169" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d981bc78b4b52e0e3b5a626533c540cb0f8af4ae2955e0066dce541080e46812"} {"question" "q-105169" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "11"] ["math" "13"] ["math" "21"] ["math" "8"] ["text" "No solution"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082816/state.json" "file_sha256" "d9